  {
   "n": 1,
   "type": "MSQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "multi | Marks +1",
   "html": "<p>In a parallel circuit, in one branch the current is I<sub>1</sub> = (100 &plusmn; 2)A and in the other branch the current&nbsp;is I<sub>2</sub> = (200 &plusmn; 5)A. Which of the following is/are correct?</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p>limiting error = &plusmn;7 A</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "<p>Probable error <img src=\"media/79/79168f5b9e438c9b3cdf.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "<p>The probable error gives a maximum possible error.</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "<p>The limiting error provides a more statistically likely range, that is a smaller margin than the&nbsp;limiting error.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "A",
    "B"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "A, B",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0
   },
   "solution": "<p><img style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\" src=\"media/f6/f669d1644a8d0ed87a64.png\"></p>"
  },
